essionals. Check with your healthcare provider for personalized medical advice.</p>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section style=\\\"margin-top:14px;text-align:center\\\">\\n        <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Prefer personalized guidance? Become a member for custom blends, monthly mailings, and priority support.</p>\\n        <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">See membership plans</a>\\n      </section>\\n\\n    </main>\\n\\n    <footer style=\\\"margin-top:18px;color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n      <div>Questions? Email <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a> or call {{PHONE}}. All purchases follow our gentle-use and return policy.</div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \nBUNDLE_END"
